public void log(int[] numbers) {            //the runtime complexity is O(n)

        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            System.out.println(numbers[i]);
        }

        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            System.out.println(numbers[i]);
        }
    }

Note: the constant will remove,
      it is still linear method
      O(n+n) = O(2n) = O(n)

